{'symbol': 'PAYX', 'date': '2022-02-02 16:35:00', 'title': "PAYCHEX RECOGNIZED AMONG THE WORLD'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES BY FORTUNE MAGAZINE", 'text': "ROCHESTER, N.Y., FEB. 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PAYCHEX, INC., A LEADING PROVIDER OF INTEGRATED HUMAN CAPITAL MANAGEMENT SOFTWARE SOLUTIONS FOR HUMAN RESOURCES, PAYROLL, BENEFITS, AND INSURANCE SERVICES, HAS BEEN NAMED TO FORTUNE® MAGAZINE'S LIST OF THE WORLD'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES."}